e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayaka14732","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"[Pallas TPU] Fix comparison lowering for unsigned integers\n\nFixes https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/23972.\n\nIn Pallas, we use `i32` for both `jnp.int32` and `jnp.uint32`, but we need to choose the correct operation (e.g. `arith.extUI` vs `arith.extSI`) or the correct attribute (e.g. `sle` vs `ule` for `arith::CmpIOp`).\n\nIn this particular issue, we need to use attributes like `ule` for `jnp.uint32`, but it's currently lowered to attributes for `jnp.int32` such as `sle`.\n\nThis PR fixes this issue by distinguishing the attributes to use for signed and unsigned types.\n","closed_at":"2024-10-09T16:28:59Z","comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/24086/comments","created_at":"2024-10-03T01:50:05Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/24086/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/24086","id":2562949814,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/24086/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCTkjjc59cXel","number":24086,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pull_request":{"diff_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/24086.diff","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/24086","merged_at":"2024-10-09T16:28:59Z","patch_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/24086.patch","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/pulls/24086"},"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/24086/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/blobs{/sha}",